OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FScattered
OL,6,Fheavy showers at first with a chance
OL,7,Fof thunder, these gradually easing
OL,8,Fthrough the evening. Cloudy overnight
OL,9,Fwith scattered light showers, mainly
OL,10,Facross the west.
OL,11,
OL,12,CWednesday:FCloudy with dry spells and
OL,13,Fa scattering of showers, generally
OL,14,Flight at first with the odd heavy
OL,15,Fshower possible later. Breezy later
OL,16,Faround the west coast and the Isles.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
